From: Hummingbird <hummingbird@redhat.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Synchronize swag v0.27.1 requirements with the vendor archive

Upstream: https://github.com/go-openapi/swag/commit/0c24346ced59
CVE: CVE-2026-93450

Generated against Grafana 13.1.7 with the go-vendor-tools.toml pre_commands.
go.mod/go.sum are the unmodified output of go get, without go mod tidy,
matching vendor generation. Module archive hashes in go.sum need not have
corresponding /go.mod hashes when Go does not load those module files.
The vendor archive already carries this fix; apply the same go.mod/go.sum
changes to Source0 so hermetic builds have consistent module requirements.

--- a/go.mod
+++ b/go.mod
